# Ideas

## Idea: Multiplayer Mode

Add a competitive mode where users can race against each other in real-time, typing the same code or text. Include leaderboards and friend challenges.

## Idea: Adaptive Difficulty

Implement an AI-powered system that adjusts the difficulty based on user performance, focusing on characters or patterns where the user struggles.

## Idea: Code Completion Hints

For code typing exercises, provide optional IntelliSense-style hints that match the typing experience in real IDEs.

## Idea: Custom Content Import

Allow users to import their own Git repositories or text files for personalized practice sessions.

## Idea: Gamification Elements

Add achievements, badges, daily streaks, and level progression to increase engagement and motivation.

## Idea: Mobile Companion App

Create a mobile app for tracking progress and practicing on the go with simplified exercises.

## Idea: Audio Feedback

Add optional sound effects for keystrokes, errors, and achievements to enhance the typing experience.

## Idea: Plugin System

Create a plugin architecture allowing community extensions for new content sources, themes, and features.

## Idea: Keyboard Layout Support

Support multiple keyboard layouts (Dvorak, Colemak, etc.) and provide layout-specific training exercises.

## Idea: Code Review Integration

Integrate with GitHub/GitLab to practice typing actual code review comments and suggestions.
